    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300411/2013004110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そっか\r\nそれは勝手に心配して悪かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013004110220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "本当よ！　私を誰だと思っているの？",
